{"version":1,"key":"article:57","content":{"id":57,"title":"TypeScript 字面量类型及小技巧","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"字面量类型。当通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"const","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明变量时，类型会被收缩为字面量类型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const a = \"Hello\";","language":"ts","uuid":"335a0dad-c45f-47a8-b9c7-eeb1164e2672","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1e73fedc-1bad-4907-8cf8-77d0a1f6baf2.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1e73fedc-1bad-4907-8cf8-77d0a1f6baf2.png","width":577.9291432990478},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"let","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明类型时，不会收缩为字面量类型，也比较合理，毕竟声明为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"let","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就表示可以继续被赋值，收缩为字面量没有意义。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"let a = \"Hello\";","language":"ts","uuid":"4b6d5722-918b-454f-bba9-db17576e14c8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_bfbaf0e4-6c7a-400e-80b5-e491612e3b1e.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_bfbaf0e4-6c7a-400e-80b5-e491612e3b1e.png","width":555.0408603961152},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当使用字面量作为对象某字段的初始值，该字段不会被收缩为字面量，无论对象使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"let","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 还是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"const","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明，这也是合理的，只是对象不能被重新赋值，但是对象的属性是可以被重新赋值的"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const obj = {\n  a: \"Hello\",\n}\nobj.a = \"World\";","language":"ts","uuid":"2de4d589-0860-446e-9202-e6dee0040851","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_50645cf2-d1eb-47f2-ac61-d058ae1cf8cf.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_50645cf2-d1eb-47f2-ac61-d058ae1cf8cf.png","width":360.89917505874064},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是当我们对象赋值给具体类型的时候就会有错误了，如设置样式"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"function App() {\n const style = {\n     position: 'fixed',\n }\n  return (\n    <div style={style}>\n      Hello World!\n    </div>\n  )\n}\nexport default App","language":"TSX","uuid":"51b49207-e8d2-45a8-9f09-d4685cd9bbee","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_14370ed4-a382-4b6e-8f6b-a641d0e2abac.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_14370ed4-a382-4b6e-8f6b-a641d0e2abac.png","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里提示的是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"string","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不能赋值给 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Position | undefined","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"Position","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的定义是"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"export type Position = Globals | \"-webkit-sticky\" | \"absolute\" | \"fixed\" | \"relative\" | \"static\" | \"sticky\";","language":"ts","uuid":"f0331939-d3c9-413e-907d-70ea5de768f6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"虽然 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"fixed","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以被赋值给 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Position","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，但是被由于判定为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"string","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型，所以不行，有两种办法："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"numbered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"手动声明类型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_bbfe96b6-d36c-42dd-a543-cd019f82371f.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_bbfe96b6-d36c-42dd-a543-cd019f82371f.png","width":277.5204301980576}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"as const","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，收缩为字面量类型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_cb83166f-78cd-4477-b349-3da1c1348888.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_cb83166f-78cd-4477-b349-3da1c1348888.png","width":237.87465445547795}]}]}],"tags":[],"bannerBg":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/C__Users_pc_.editor_resources_dmitrii-shirnin-KU4Xa_u-rNk-unsplash_c06ae80a-a835-4441-b074-65414881efec_b3c3dc55-7ac0-46d0-a179-03ea9a53bf11.jpg","createTime":1681633333000,"updateTime":1775869721642},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1775869721642}}